{"4660200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oink Splash Party", "steam_appid": 4660200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Oink Splash Party!  </h2><br>Dive into the wildest party on the open sea, where Oinks battle across giant inflatable waterparks.<br><br>Compete in frantic matches packed with physics-driven mayhem, score goals, complete objectives, and knock opponents straight into the sea.<br><br>Become an Oink, customize your look, and jump into unpredictable multiplayer battles with friends and rivals alike!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos You Can Control </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inflate yourself to turn into a bouncing ball<br></li><li>Deflate mid-air to control your landing<br></li><li>Stomp on inflatables to reach impossible places<br></li><li>Smash into opponents and send them SPLASH into the water</li></ul><br>No two matches ever feel the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=900 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/a763750f971e23a0e3f302b1e80c20b7.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=900 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/9923ece53bbdedbb96c526f147edbd8f.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=900 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7eb791c809be37cdabcf7481f40b7d73.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Giant Inflatable Waterparks </h2><br>Battle across vibrant floating arenas packed with:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Massive bouncy platforms<br></li><li>Crazy inflatable obstacles<br></li><li>Slides, gaps, and risky shortcuts<br></li><li>Fun objectives that require the best team</li></ul><br>Fall into the sea? No problem. Swim back and jump straight into the chaos-packed action again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=1170 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/020a1c8c28a88c083da7c3bd299c9427.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party Modes &amp; Fun Rivalry </h2><br>Play with friends — or against them — in fast-paced, competitive modes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Score Battle</strong></li></ul>Outplay your opponents and score your way to victory.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Galleon Rush</strong></li></ul>Grab more coins than everyone else… and don’t get punched off!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Punch King</strong></li></ul>Fight for the highest point of the waterpark and defend your crown from oinks trying to knock you off.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Private Matches</strong></li></ul>Create custom games with your own rules and enjoy chaotic battles with friends.<br><br>More modes are on the way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/d15306be4801e95ddd3e4140a163a691.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Oink Yours  </h2><br>Stand out in the splash:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your Oink’s look<br></li><li>Express your oinky-style<br></li><li>Be the most iconic piggy in the park!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/74c26b846f5a9cb0eb7f20436119da8a.mp4?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><br>Our Oinks are busy inflating waterparks and testing questionable ideas, but the best feedback usually comes from players.<br><br><strong>Why Early Access?</strong><br><br>Because party games are better when they're built with the people who play them.<br><br>We need your help testing maps, sharing feedback, reporting bugs, and deciding what chaos comes next.<br><br><strong>Oink Splash Party launches in Early Access with:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 unique waterpark maps<br></li><li>Party and private matches<br></li><li>Map missions and character customization<br></li><li>A seasonal ranked system</li></ul><br>Multiple game modes, maps, and surprises are already being baked and will be coming soon!<br><br><strong>Join us early and help our Oinks shape the party!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.poster.avif?t=1782833960\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660200/extras/7b7f6fabdbee2db8568afef75e5577e9.webm?t=1782833960\" type=\"video/webm; co